  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability in SPlayer v3.7 or prior. When SPlayer requests the URL of a media file (video or audio), it is possible to gain arbitrary remote code execution due to a buffer overflow caused by an exceeding length of data as the 'Content-Type' parameter.",
